# ===== 白名单制:默认忽略所有,仅放行下列入库 =====
*

# 项目元数据与文档
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!LICENSE
!README.md
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES

# 依赖与构建配置
!package.json
!package-lock.json

# 应用源码
!index.html
!css/
!css/**
!js/
!js/**
!electron/
!electron/**

# 运行时资源(打包后仍需读取)
!start.json
!up_pb.svg

# ===== 始终忽略(即使被上方匹配) =====
node_modules/
dist/
.claude/
*.log
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
